  "comment": {
    "text": "Value of the Used by column, tile line and compact row of a skill set or a knowledge base in the AI section: how many AI agents use it, for two or more. {{agentsCount}} is that number, never 0 or 1. It also follows the Used by label after a colon. Use a form that is correct for any number from 2 up, or a neutral 'Agents: N' form where the noun would have to change with the number.",
    "is_auto": true,
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T08:14:17.509Z",
    "model": "claude-fable-5-2"
  },
  "usage": [
    {
      "file_path": "/packages/client/src/helpers/usedByAgents.ts",
      "line_number": 49,
      "context": "* number.\n */\n export const getUsedByText = (t: TTranslation, count?: number | null) => {\n if (!count || count < 0) return USED_BY_NONE;\n if (count === 1) return t(\"Common:OneAgent\");\n return t(\"Common:AgentsNumber\", { agentsCount: count });\n };",
      "module": "/packages/client"
    }
  ],
